       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.  SPOHIST.
       AUTHOR.      KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).

      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *D*                                                 *
      *D* S P O H I S T                                   *
      *D*                                                 *
      *D* THIS SUB PROGRAM LOADS PURCHASE ORDERS,         *
      *D* RECEIVING SLIPS, INVOICES FROM THE STORES       *
      *D* DATA BASE INTO THE HISTORY DATA BASE 'STHIST'   *
      *D* THIS SUBROUTINE IS CALLED JUST BEFORE THE       *
      *D* PURCHASE ORDER INFORMATION IS DELETED FROM THE  *
      *D* STORES DATA BASE.                               *
      *D*                                                 *
      *P* NOTE THIS SUBROUTINE IS CALLED BY: TAPODELT     *
      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *C* CHANGES
      *C*
      *C* JUNE 23, 1992   CR KALMAN
      *C* TWO INDICATORS FOR THE PAY UPON RECEIPT PROJECT
      *C* NEEDED TO BE MOVED TO PO HISTORY DATABASE ALONG
      *C* WITH THE PO. THEY ARE THE PO-INVOICELESS-IND AND
      *C* THE PO-NO-CHECK-INDIC.
      *
      *C  02/21/94  JEFF BUNGO #6449
      *C    ADDED NEW FIELDS TO THE HISTORY DATABASE FILES TO
      *C    MATCH THE LIVE DATABASE FILES.  USE THESE ADDITIONAL
      *C    FIELDS IN THE MOVE TO HISTORY.
      *C
      *C  10FEB1995  DAVE PLUM
      *C    REVISED LOGIC DEALING WITH LITERAL VALUES SUCH AS:
      *C    "BELOW", "AS REL", "ASAP", OR "RUSH" THAT MAY APPEAR
      *C    IN THE PO SHIP DATE FIELD IN THE LIVE DATABASE.  IN THE
      *C    HISTORY DATABASE THIS FIELD IS A NUMERIC FIELD SO WE
      *C    MUST MOVE ZEROS INSTEAD OF THE LITERAL VALUE.
      *C
      *C  SEPTEMBER 1996 JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C    EXPANDED DATE FIELDS TO COMPLY TO YEAR 2000.
      *C
      *C  11/22/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE QS9000 TRACKING INFORMATION TO
      *C    HISTORY (DRCVTRAK).
      *C
      *C  05/06/97  CA YODER
      *C    CORRECTED PARAGRAPH 631-GET-FREIGHT-LOOP.  THE PROGRAM
      *C    WAS BLOWING UP ON A DATA DECIMAL ERROR BECAUSE THE
      *C    FRT-BILL-DATE-CN WAS BEING MOVED TO FORMAT-DATE AS
      *C    "20      ".  ADDED LOGIC TO MAKE SURE THAT THE REST
      *C    OF THE DATE IS NUMERIC BEFORE FORMATTING IT.
      *C
      *C  10/31/97  CA YODER
      *C    SHIP DATE WAS NOT BEING PROPERLY MOVED INTO HISTORY IF
      *C    IT WAS = 0.  ADDED CHECK TO SEE IF ALL ZEROS, THEN MOVE
      *C    "00" TO CENTURY.
      *C
      *C  08/13/98  CA YODER
      *C    PAD12 FIELDS WERE NOT BEING MOVED TO HISTORY.  ADDED
      *C    THEM TO COPYLIB MEMBER DPORECDH AND ADDED LOGIC IN THIS
      *C    PROGRAM TO MOVE THE FIELDS TO HISTORY.
      *C
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01 *  06/17/2003   DAN RAUCH    DCR01
DCR01 *    ADDED LOGIC FOR PO LOGGING
      *C
      *C  10/16/2003  CA YODER
      *C    THE QS9000 ITEM FLAG WAS NOT BEING MOVED TO HISTORY.
      *C    THIS CAUSED THE QS9000 TO NOT SHOW UP ON THE PO INQUIRY
      *C    SCREEN.  EEC FIELDS AND NOTIFY USER-ID WERE ALSO MISSING.
      *C    CORRECTED PROGRAM.
      *C
      ***********************************************************

