           05  WORK-DATE.
               10  WD-CC              PIC X(2).
               10  WD-DATE.
                   15  WD-DATE-YY     PIC X(2).
                   15  FILLER         PIC X(4).
           05  WORK-DATE-9 REDEFINES WORK-DATE  PIC 9(8).

